                                                "sense_id": "9cc4c08e-789a-3361-a284-eca2d97a6a46",
                                                "text": "Destitution forces many asylum seekers to end up working for extremely low wages in catering, cleaning and construction, for example, without any protection against unscrupulous employers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
